      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "CORE TERMS\n• Image = packaged template\n• Container = running instance of an image\n• Registry = image storage/distribution\n• Volume = data persistence/sharing\n• `EXPOSE` documents a port; it does not publish it to the host\n• Containers share the host kernel; VMs run a guest OS/kernel",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CORE TERMS\n• Image = packaged template\n• Container = running instance of an image\n• Registry = image storage/distribution\n• Volume = data persistence/sharing\n• `EXPOSE` documents a port; it does not publish it to the host\n• Containers share the host kernel; VMs run a guest OS/kernel",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "p4-0023",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 390,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 190,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 253,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 299,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1761490000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "PRODUCTION CHECKLIST\n• Version images; avoid relying only on `latest`\n• Keep secrets out of image layers\n• Use `.dockerignore`; install reproducibly\n• Run as non-root; scan and patch images\n• Keep durable state in managed storage/volumes\n• Health checks, graceful shutdown, logs and rollback",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PRODUCTION CHECKLIST\n• Version images; avoid relying only on `latest`\n• Keep secrets out of image layers\n• Use `.dockerignore`; install reproducibly\n• Run as non-root; scan and patch images\n• Keep durable state in managed storage/volumes\n• Health checks, graceful shutdown, logs and rollback",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "p4-0024",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 110,
      "y": 635,
      "width": 1600,
      "height": 110,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#355f7a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 264,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 312,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1761490000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "MENTAL MODEL: build once → store versioned image → deploy the same artifact. Containers are replaceable; important data should survive replacement.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "MENTAL MODEL: build once → store versioned image → deploy the same artifact. Containers are replaceable; important data should survive replacement.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
